#==============================================================================================
#
#   style_sheet_list - CSS::StyleSheetList: the CSS style sheets of a document or shadow root
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleSheetList.cpp (lines 1-277) and the inline members of
#       StyleSheetList.h (lines 17-71): "create a CSS style sheet", "add a CSS style sheet",
#       "remove a CSS style sheet", keeping the list in tree order, and the style invalidation
#       that adding or removing a sheet causes.
